ACT VII OF 1994
ACT VII OF 1994
BALOCHISTAN EDUCATION FOUNDATION ACT, 1994
CHAPTER I
PRELIMINARY
2. Definitions: ‑‑In this Act unless there
is anything repugnant in the subject or context:
(a) "Agency" means
any department or organization of the Provincial Government and includes a
corporation or other body set up and controlled by the Government;
"Board" means the
Board of Directors of the Foundation constituted under subsection (1) of
section 5;
(c) "Chairman" means the Chairman of the
Board;
(d) "Committee" means
a Committee constituted under subsection (6) of section 6;
(e) "Director" means
member of the Board of Directors of the Foundation;
(f) "Fund" means a fund constituted under
subsection (1) of section 14;
(g) "Foundation" means the Balochistan Education
Foundation established under subsection l (1) of section 3;
(h) "Government" moans Government of
Balochistan;
(i) "Grant" means a
sum of non‑refundable amount advanced to an educational institution or
organization from the Foundation Fund;
(j) "Loan" means a
refundable sum of money advanced by the Foundation to an educational
institution or organization;
(k) "Land" includes
buildings and benefits arising out of land and things attached to the earth or
permanently attached to earth;
(1) "Managing
Director" means the Managing Director of the Foundation appointed under
subsection (1) of section 7;
(m) "Member" means a member
of the Board;
(n) "Non‑Government
Organization" means an organization set up with private finance for
advancement of education and registered under the Voluntary Social Welfare
Agencies (Registration and Control) Ordinance, 1961;
(o) "Prescribed" means
prescribed by the rules and regulations under this Act;
(p) "Rules" means the
rules framed under this Act; and
(q) "Regulations"
means the regulations framed under this Act.
